The terminal state of an ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/abstract-machine.td")} reached when the current term is in ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/normal-form.td")} (i.e., no evaluation rule applies), signaling completion of evaluation.
